+++ b/docs/source/changelog.rst
@@ -5,6 +5,17 @@ Changelog
 Upcoming version (not yet released)
 -----------------------------------
 
+Consumer compatibility patch
+^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
+
+- Add opt-in deterministic physics before kernel compilation/capture and expose
+  the same simulation flag in play and tracking evaluation. Keep overflow warnings.
+- Preserve world-frame tracking velocity rewards under their saved-config names.
+- Keep the consumer rsl-rl 5.4.1 fork and adapt pose consumers to the pinned
+  MuJoCo Warp main quaternion API.
+- Select Warp/OptiX cameras explicitly; keep OptiX sensing outside capture and
+  warm up lazy renderer resources before capture.
+
 Added
 ^^^^^
 
